msgstr "PHP date format, e.g. “d.m.Y” (24.12.2026) or “j. F Y” (24. Dezember 2026). Empty = date format from the WordPress settings. Applies in the site language; emails and documents in other languages use their language’s format. The wpcap_date_format filter takes precedence."

