msgstr "PHP time format, e.g. “H:i” (20:00) or “g:i a” (8:00 pm). Empty = time format from the WordPress settings; 24-hour (H:i) on ticket PDFs. The wpcap_time_format filter takes precedence."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:200
msgid "Ratenlimits"
msgstr "Rate limits"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:202
msgid "Schützt Checkout, Warteliste und Bestellportal vor automatisierten Anfragen. Die Untergrenzen sind fest, damit echte Käufer nicht ausgesperrt werden; Filter (z. B. wpcap_checkout_ip_limit) haben Vorrang."
msgstr "Protects checkout, waitlist and order portal against automated requests. The minimums are fixed so real buyers are not locked out; filters (e.g. wpcap_checkout_ip_limit) take precedence."

