msgstr "Empty fields take the account of the chart of accounts. Account numbers with 4 to 8 digits, BU keys with 1 to 4 digits. Please agree the accounts with your tax adviser. The filter wpcap_datev_accounts still has the last word."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:529
msgid "Bestimmt die Standardkonten; leere Felder der Tabelle übernehmen sie."
msgstr "Determines the default accounts; empty fields of the table take them."

